openapi: 3.0.3
info:
  title: Gizra API — Customer, Restaurant & Driver
  description: >-
    Complete API surface for the Gizra delivery platform, generated directly
    from the Laravel route table and controller validation rules.


    Every parameter shown is one the backend actually reads. Required fields are
    pre-filled in the body or enabled as query params; optional fields are
    listed in each request description and left disabled.


    ## Getting a token

    1. Run the relevant **Login** request (Auth folder in each app section).

    2. Copy `token` from the response into the matching collection variable
    (`customer_token`, `vendor_token`, `dm_token`).


    ## Variables

    `base_url` defaults to production. Change it to point at staging.
  version: 1.0.0
  contact: {}
